  </data>
  <data name="Ota.Tips" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>How to:
1. Pick firmware\grok1.7.bin (stock V2.13 + anti-stuck-key + key remap; never grok1.0~1.5)
2. Keep USB connected; do not unplug, power off or close this window while upgrading
3. On failure the board stays in Bootloader — just retry. ISP: grok1.7 or stock V2.13 only</value>
