File: {0}
Size: {1} bytes
Address: 0x{2}

Please note:
· Do not unplug USB, power off or close this window while upgrading
· The board jumps to the APP only after the write and CRC pass; on failure it stays in Bootloader and you can retry
· Recommended image: grok1.7.bin (stock base + anti-stuck-key + key remap, vector table untouched; grok1.0~1.5 are all forbidden)
· Never ISP-flash grok1.1.bin again (longer tail, easily truncated and bricked)

Start now?</value>
